{"identifier":"Achievem1955","title":"Achievement USA","description":"General Motors celebrates production of 50 millionth automobile with a parade through Flint, Michigan.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/Achievem1955/Achievem1955_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/Achievem1955","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/Achievem1955","durationMs":604001,"level":"C2","topic":"Car culture: Ceremonies","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Achievement USA","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":22000,"endMs":32001,"text":"It looks like an ordinary day in the USA, but in the city of Flint, Michigan, all is right."},{"startMs":31001,"endMs":35000,"text":"And the older boys and girls are let out of school."},{"startMs":36000,"endMs":38001,"text":"This is a day. The whole town is a vessel."},{"startMs":39001,"endMs":41001,"text":"Yes, Siree, there's going to be a parade, too."},{"startMs":42000,"endMs":45000,"text":"And what's a parade without festive bunting and gala decorations?"},{"startMs":48000,"endMs":52001,"text":"And bands. So the boys with the tall shakos practice their strut."},{"startMs":54000,"endMs":58000,"text":"And all over town, the final touches are put on sleek and shiny floats."},{"startMs":58001,"endMs":61001,"text":"For this parade is going to be a mile long."},{"startMs":63000,"endMs":66001,"text":"And some of the out-of-town floats have to be hustled over the road to make it on time."},{"startMs":68000,"endMs":76001,"text":"And in the town auditorium, a troupe of Broadway and Hollywood artists feverishly polish their song and dance routines, symbolizing the teamwork and"},{"startMs":76001,"endMs":78000,"text":"progress of GM people everywhere."},{"startMs":79000,"endMs":83001,"text":"For their show is to be played to a standout audience of very important guests."},{"startMs":84000,"endMs":90000,"text":"Hundreds of guests, many of whom will arrive in Flint on a train pulled by a glistening diesel."},{"startMs":90001,"endMs":93001,"text":"A golden engine for a golden day."},{"startMs":95001,"endMs":101001,"text":"Yes, Siree, there's excitement from coast to coast on this day, everywhere General Motors people are at work."},{"startMs":102000,"endMs":109000,"text":"For today in the USA, the entire GM family is playing host, with open house at every plant."},{"startMs":109001,"endMs":117000,"text":"For this is a special day, a once in a lifetime day, a day of achievement for the whole USA."},{"startMs":118001,"endMs":124000,"text":"For on this day, General Motors is building its 50 millionth car."},{"startMs":125001,"endMs":127001,"text":"No one has ever come close to that before."},{"startMs":128001,"endMs":131000,"text":"So no wonder celebration is in the very air."},{"startMs":132000,"endMs":135001,"text":"The bunting and decorations are up. The floats are almost ready."},{"startMs":136001,"endMs":138001,"text":"The red carpets are out."},{"startMs":143000,"endMs":148001,"text":"The signs of welcome are proudly displayed."},{"startMs":149001,"endMs":151001,"text":"Mothers are bringing the children to town."},{"startMs":152000,"endMs":154001,"text":"For on this day of days, parking is no problem."},{"startMs":155000,"endMs":159000,"text":"For Buick has provided a stomping ground for the cowboy and diver scent."},{"startMs":161000,"endMs":164000,"text":"And Buick's general manager, Ivan Wiles, drops in."},{"startMs":165000,"endMs":170001,"text":"And now on the Chevrolet production line, an historic event is about to occur."},{"startMs":171001,"endMs":181000,"text":"With some of its millions of predecessors marching before, and the first of more millions following behind, a golden chassis arrives at the body drop."},{"startMs":182001,"endMs":192001,"text":"Mark you well this day in American progress, for the scurrying clock of history is striking ten this Tuesday morning of November 23rd, 1954."},{"startMs":193000,"endMs":200000,"text":"As down from a loft swings the golden body of a car that's been 46 years in the making."},{"startMs":201000,"endMs":205001,"text":"A car that marks a proud feat of the teamwork of American productive achievement."},{"startMs":206000,"endMs":209000,"text":"Unmatched anywhere at any time."},{"startMs":210000,"endMs":215001,"text":"The manufacture by the people of one company of 50 million motor cars."},{"startMs":217000,"endMs":218001,"text":"This is achievement."},{"startMs":219001,"endMs":221000,"text":"Achievement by a great nation."},{"startMs":221001,"endMs":225000,"text":"By the 160 million free people of that nation."},{"startMs":225001,"endMs":233001,"text":"For to the cooperative efforts of the men and women of General Motors working together, must be added the work of the countless thousands who supply GM."},{"startMs":234001,"endMs":237000,"text":"And the countless tens of thousands who supply them."},{"startMs":238000,"endMs":243001,"text":"And the thousands of dealers and salesmen and servicemen who sell and care for GM products."},{"startMs":244001,"endMs":247001,"text":"And the investors who entrust savings and earnings to GM."},{"startMs":248000,"endMs":251000,"text":"And the millions upon millions of customers."},{"startMs":251001,"endMs":255000,"text":"Whose confidence also has helped make possible this day."},{"startMs":256000,"endMs":257001,"text":"And this event."},{"startMs":259000,"endMs":268000,"text":"So with pride shared by every GM man and woman everywhere, Chevrolet's General Manager, T.H. Keating, marks the occasion with General Motors"},{"startMs":268000,"endMs":270000,"text":"President, Harlow H. Curtis."},{"startMs":271000,"endMs":279000,"text":"Mr. Curtis, it is a real honor and a privilege for Chevrolet to produce the 50 millionth car for General Motors."},{"startMs":279001,"endMs":281001,"text":"It is a history making achievement."},{"startMs":282001,"endMs":285000,"text":"And Harlow H. Keating, in Wellfield, very proud."},{"startMs":286000,"endMs":291000,"text":"It is a pleasure for me, Mr. Curtis, to present to you the key to the 50 millionth car."},{"startMs":292000,"endMs":293000,"text":"Thank you very much, Mr. Keating."},{"startMs":294000,"endMs":295001,"text":"Congratulations. Thank you, sir."},{"startMs":297000,"endMs":302001,"text":"Men of Chevrolet and Fisher, my sincere congratulations."},{"startMs":303001,"endMs":309000,"text":"You have just helped accomplish something that has never been accomplished before."},{"startMs":310001,"endMs":317001,"text":"You have produced the 50 millionth car built by General Motors in the"},{"startMs":317001,"endMs":321000,"text":"United States since 1908."},{"startMs":323000,"endMs":329000,"text":"This is a milestone unique in the world's industrial history."},{"startMs":330000,"endMs":341000,"text":"It was the vision of a bare handful of men here in Flint that launched General Motors in 1908."},{"startMs":343000,"endMs":347001,"text":"The automobile industry was a struggling infant at that time."},{"startMs":349000,"endMs":353000,"text":"In other automobile companies, the same vision existed."},{"startMs":354001,"endMs":365000,"text":"Vision of the automobile, both as an essential means of transportation and as a creator of jobs."},{"startMs":365001,"endMs":372001,"text":"The result has been the development of an industry that makes the greatest single"},{"startMs":372001,"endMs":377000,"text":"contribution of any to the strength of the national economy."},{"startMs":378001,"endMs":385001,"text":"Over the years, it has constituted a principal source of our country's dynamic growth."},{"startMs":386001,"endMs":393001,"text":"The 50 millionth General Motors car produced in this country stands as a symbol"},{"startMs":393001,"endMs":395001,"text":"of vision of accomplishment to date."},{"startMs":396001,"endMs":401001,"text":"It also is a symbol of progress for the future."},{"startMs":402001,"endMs":404000,"text":"50 million cars."},{"startMs":405000,"endMs":410000,"text":"So hoist those flags on high, blow those whistles, and start that parade."},{"startMs":431000,"endMs":439001,"text":"The entire GM line is represented here, glistening new models of the famous five that make automotive history every day."},{"startMs":440001,"endMs":448001,"text":"The entire GM line is represented here, GMC truck and coach with surging power for the wheels of progress."},{"startMs":451000,"endMs":459000,"text":"Electromoted with the revolutionary power for the wheels of steel that put new life in the old iron horses."},{"startMs":462001,"endMs":470000,"text":"Fisher bottom that's led a parade of beauty from the days of Demure, Miss 1908, to modern as tomorrow, Miss 1955."},{"startMs":476001,"endMs":480001,"text":"UAWCIO representing more than 300,000 members of the mighty GMT."},{"startMs":485000,"endMs":492000,"text":"AC spark plug, as if you couldn't tell, and Sparky and Sludgy, who all work"},{"startMs":492000,"endMs":494000,"text":"together too to make this nation strong."},{"startMs":495001,"endMs":505001,"text":"And here's General Motors Institute that helps train men and women to carry on the tradition of achievement and turnstell that puts GM's hardware out in front."},{"startMs":510000,"endMs":514001,"text":"And of course, little did they dream it."},{"startMs":515000,"endMs":523000,"text":"Here's the very first GM car, the 1908 Cadillac that started the biggest parade of industrial products in all history."},{"startMs":524001,"endMs":528000,"text":"And GM's million, a 1919 Oldsmobile."},{"startMs":530000,"endMs":533001,"text":"And the 5 million, a Pontiac from way back in 1926."},{"startMs":536001,"endMs":540000,"text":"And the 10 million, a Buick of only three years later, 1929."},{"startMs":542000,"endMs":546001,"text":"And the 25 million, a Chevrolet of only yesterday, 1940."},{"startMs":549000,"endMs":551000,"text":"Oh, it's a great day, all right."},{"startMs":552000,"endMs":562001,"text":"A salute to Mr. and Mrs. America, to all of us Americans, who as one people have pioneered and protected the way of life that is the USA."},{"startMs":563001,"endMs":576000,"text":"Whose courage, confidence, and cooperative accomplishments are proudly symbolized here today by this unparalleled achievement that marks a milestone of progress"},{"startMs":576000,"endMs":578001,"text":"pointing the way towards still greater things."},{"startMs":579001,"endMs":582001,"text":"For all of us, everywhere to share."},{"startMs":586000,"endMs":592000,"text":"Teamwork, teamwork, the nation's secret was teamwork."},{"startMs":592001,"endMs":597001,"text":"And no doubters and scoffers said this is as far as you'll get."},{"startMs":598001,"endMs":604001,"text":"GM answer, you ain't seen nothing yet."}]}